{"path":"biology/genetics/mendel/experiment-design-multiple","title":"显隐性判断测交（全黑 vs 出现白）","type":"example","html":"<p>某小鼠毛色黑色（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span>）对白色（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span>）为显性。现有一黑色雄鼠，要判断它是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">AA</span></span></span></span> 还是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Aa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span>，最简便可靠的方法是（ ）</p>\n<p>A. 让该雄鼠与多只白色雌鼠交配，观察后代毛色</p>\n<p>B. 让该雄鼠与黑色雌鼠交配，观察后代毛色</p>\n<p>C. 取该雄鼠的精子用显微镜观察</p>\n<p>D. 让该雄鼠与多只黑色雌鼠交配，统计比例</p>\n<ul>\n<li>三种策略对比（背住）：</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>判定</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>测交</td>\n<td>显性个体基因型</td>\n<td>出现隐性性状 → 杂合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自交</td>\n<td>能自交的植物（最简便）</td>\n<td>性状分离 → 杂合（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">AA</span></span></span></span> 自交后代全显性，不出现性状分离）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>花粉鉴定（显微）</td>\n<td>能区分配子性状</td>\n<td>两种花粉 → 杂合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li>题干&quot;多只&quot;提醒：单只后代偶然性大（如只生 1 只是黑），<strong>统计数量足够</strong>才可靠——答题时常写&quot;进行多次繁殖/统计多只后代&quot;；</li>\n<li>变式：白色（隐性）个体直接是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">aa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">aa</span></span></span></span>（无需测交）——隐性性状只能纯合；</li>\n<li>若问&quot;验证分离定律&quot;：选<strong>自交</strong>（显性杂合子自交后代 3:1 最直观）或<strong>测交</strong>（1:1）都可，注意题目问的是&quot;最简便&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>测交原理</strong>：与<strong>隐性纯合子</strong>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">aa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">aa</span></span></span></span> 白鼠）交配——测交后代的表现型反映待测个体产生的配子种类（该雄鼠只含 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span> 还是含 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span> 各半）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>后代<strong>全黑</strong> ⇒ 亲代雄鼠只产生 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span> 配子 ⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">AA</span></span></span></span>；</li>\n<li>后代<strong>出现白色</strong>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">aa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">aa</span></span></span></span>）⇒ 雄鼠产生 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span> 配子 ⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Aa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选 <strong>A</strong>（A 的对象是隐性个体，遗传学称之为测交）。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>适用特征</strong>：判断显性个体纯合/杂合 → <strong>&quot;测交 + 隐性纯合&quot;</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>待测显性个体 × <strong>隐性纯合子</strong>；子代出现隐性性状 ⇒ 杂合；全显性 ⇒ 纯合。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>B、D（黑×黑）：可能连续出黑，无法区分 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">AA</span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Aa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span> ✘；</li>\n<li>A：白鼠是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">aa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">aa</span></span></span></span>，一测就明 ✓。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>20 秒选 A</strong>——&quot;测交必选隐性纯合&quot;是铁律。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"某小鼠毛色黑色（ A A A ）对白色（ a a a ）为显性。现有一黑色雄鼠，要判断它是 A A AA AA 还是 A a Aa A a ，最简便可靠的方法是（ ） A. 让该雄鼠与多只白色雌鼠交配，观察后代毛色 B. 让该雄鼠与黑色雌鼠","source":"自编（经典考法）","difficulty":"较难","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"测交对象必须是\"隐性纯合\"（否则后代不能揭示基因型）；后代出现隐性性状即说明待测个体含隐性基因（杂合）；样本量要足够大（统计意义）。","fit":["显性个体是纯合还是杂合","用测交验证分离定律","选填题"],"updated":"Mon Feb 24 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"biology","title":"生物"},{"slug":"genetics","title":"遗传与进化"},{"slug":"mendel","title":"遗传规律"},{"slug":"experiment-design-multiple","title":"显隐性判断测交（全黑 vs 出现白）"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"epistasis-12-3-1","title":"显性上位 12:3:1（9+3 合并）","type":"example"},{"slug":"epistasis-homozygous","title":"上位效应中的纯合比例（单显 1/3）","type":"example"},{"slug":"gene-location","title":"基因定位实验（正反交判断）","type":"example"},{"slug":"genetic-9331","title":"9331 变式比例（拆分法）","type":"example"},{"slug":"lethal-ratio","title":"显性纯合致死比例（筛除 1/4）","type":"example"},{"slug":"mendel","title":"遗传规律","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"multi-gene-types","title":"遗传多对基因·比值变式全表与题眼","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"two-disease-prob","title":"常染色体+伴X 两病概率（拆分相乘）","type":"example"},{"slug":"two-gene-ratio","title":"两对基因概率（拆分法）","type":"example"}]}